          "sourceRoman": "mukhyavā gi navarātriyalli namma kuladēvaranna viśēṣavāgi ārādhane māḍuvudē navarātri akhaṁṭha dīpa sthāpaneyanna māḍi adaralli tuppada dīpa mukhyavāgi tuppadiṁda dīpa ērisidāga ā tuppa namma ēnu vātāvaraṇadalliruva āksijan ide adanna pyūriphai māḍutte aṁta gāḷiyanna śuddha māḍikoḍutte ",
          "english": "In Navarātri, the principal point is the special worship of our family deity. Establish the uninterrupted lamp, with a ghee lamp in it. In particular, when the lamp is kindled with ghee, the speaker says that it purifies the oxygen in the atmosphere and cleans the air. This is his explanation of the ghee lamp, retained here as a recorded claim.",
