      "originalScript": "ಆಚಮನ ಮಾಡಿರಿ.\nkeśavāya svāhā\nnārāyaṇāya svāhā\nmādhavāya svāhā\ngovinda viṣṇu madhusūdana trivikrama vāmana\nśrīdhara hṛṣīkeśa padmanābha dāmodara saṅkarṣaṇa\nvāsudeva pradyumna aniruddha puruṣottama adhokṣaja\nnārasimha acyuta janārdana upendra\nharaye namaḥ śrīkṛṣṇāya namaḥ\nಮತ್ತೊಮ್ಮೆ ಆಚಮನ ಮಾಡಿರಿ.\nkeśavāya svāhā\nnārāyaṇāya svāhā\nmādhavāya svāhā\ngovinda viṣṇu madhusūdana trivikrama vāmana\nśrīdhara hṛṣīkeśa padmanābha dāmodara saṅkarṣaṇa\nvāsudeva pradyumna aniruddha puruṣottama adhokṣaja\nnārasimha acyuta janārdana upendra\nharaye namaḥ śrīkṛṣṇāya namaḥ\n",
      "romanText": "ācamana māḍiri.\nkeśavāya svāhā\nnārāyaṇāya svāhā\nmādhavāya svāhā\ngovinda viṣṇu madhusūdana trivikrama vāmana\nśrīdhara hṛṣīkeśa padmanābha dāmodara saṅkarṣaṇa\nvāsudeva pradyumna aniruddha puruṣottama adhokṣaja\nnārasimha acyuta janārdana upendra\nharaye namaḥ śrīkṛṣṇāya namaḥ\nmattomme ācamana māḍiri.\nkeśavāya svāhā\nnārāyaṇāya svāhā\nmādhavāya svāhā\ngovinda viṣṇu madhusūdana trivikrama vāmana\nśrīdhara hṛṣīkeśa padmanābha dāmodara saṅkarṣaṇa\nvāsudeva pradyumna aniruddha puruṣottama adhokṣaja\nnārasimha acyuta janārdana upendra\nharaye namaḥ śrīkṛṣṇāya namaḥ\n",
      "verifyNotes": "The 24 divine names are repeated as two separate ācamana sequences. Caption consonants and datives are unreliable. Short names after the first three are retained as heard in fine transcription/captions; not expanded into unspoken full datives. Short names after the first three are retained as heard in fine transcription/captions; not expanded into unspoken full datives. All timestamps are caption-aligned; no direct human listening is claimed. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified.",
