      "originalScript": "ಗುರುವಂದನೆ.\nśrīgurubhyo namaḥ paramagurubhyo namaḥ\nśrīmadānandatīrtha bhagavatpādācāryebhyo namaḥ\nvedavyāsāya namaḥ sarasvatyai namaḥ brahmaṇe namaḥ\nbhāratyai namaḥ vāgīśebhyo namaḥ lakṣmyai namaḥ nārāyaṇāya namaḥ\nekādaśasthāne asmat kuladevatāyai namaḥ\nನಿಮ್ಮ ಕುಲದೇವರು ಏನೋ, ಅವರ ಹೆಸರನ್ನ ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಹೇಳಿಕೊಳ್ಳಿ. ನರಸಿಂಹ ದೇವರಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ\nnarasiṁhāya namaḥ\nವೆಂಕಟೇಶ ದೇವರಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ\nveṅkaṭeśāya namaḥ\nನಿಮ್ಮ ಕುಲದೇವರ ಹೆಸರನ್ನು\nekādaśasthāne kuladevatāyai namaḥ śrī vāsudevāya namaḥ\n",
      "romanText": "guruvaṁdane.\nśrīgurubhyo namaḥ paramagurubhyo namaḥ\nśrīmadānandatīrtha bhagavatpādācāryebhyo namaḥ\nvedavyāsāya namaḥ sarasvatyai namaḥ brahmaṇe namaḥ\nbhāratyai namaḥ vāgīśebhyo namaḥ lakṣmyai namaḥ nārāyaṇāya namaḥ\nekādaśasthāne asmat kuladevatāyai namaḥ\nnimma kuladēvaru ēnō, avara hesaranna illi hēḷikoḷḷi. narasiṁha dēvarāgiddare\nnarasiṁhāya namaḥ\nveṁkaṭēśa dēvarāgiddare\nveṅkaṭeśāya namaḥ\nnimma kuladēvara hesarannu\nekādaśasthāne kuladevatāyai namaḥ śrī vāsudevāya namaḥ\n",
      "verifyNotes": "The family-deity examples are embedded in Kannada. Preserve Narasiṃha and Veṅkaṭeśa alternatives and the eleventh-place instruction. vāgīśebhyo and ekādaśasthāne/asmat remain uncertain: GPT variants vāgbhe, ekāsanasthāne/aśvattha; captions favor eleventh-place formulation. Eleventh-place wording uncertain as above. All timestamps are caption-aligned; no direct human listening is claimed. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified.",
