      "originalScript": "ಪ್ರಾಣಾಯಾಮ. ತಲೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಕೈ ಇಟ್ಟುಕೊಳ್ಳಿ.\npraṇavasya parabrahma ṛṣiḥ\nಹೃದಯದಲ್ಲಿ\nparamātmā devatā\nಮೂಗನ್ನು ಮುಟ್ಟೋದು\ndevī gāyatrī chandaḥ prāṇāyāme viniyogaḥ\nಹೀಗೆ ಅಂತ ಹೇಳಿ ಮೂಗನ್ನು ಹಿಡುಕೊಳ್ಳಿ. ಪ್ರಾಣಾಯಾಮ ಬಂದವರು ಪ್ರಾಣಾಯಾಮ ಮಾಡಿರಿ.\noṁ bhūḥ oṁ bhuvaḥ oṁ svaḥ\noṁ mahaḥ oṁ janaḥ oṁ tapaḥ oṁ satyaṁ\ntatsaviturvareṇyaṁ bhargo devasya dhīmahi\ndhiyo yo naḥ pracodayāt\noṁ āpo jyotīraso amṛtaṁ brahma bhūrbhuvassuvarom\n",
      "romanText": "prāṇāyāma. taleyalli kai iṭṭukoḷḷi.\npraṇavasya parabrahma ṛṣiḥ\nhṛdayadalli\nparamātmā devatā\nmūgannu muṭṭōdu\ndevī gāyatrī chandaḥ prāṇāyāme viniyogaḥ\nhīge aṁta hēḷi mūgannu hiḍukoḷḷi. prāṇāyāma baṁdavaru prāṇāyāma māḍiri.\noṁ bhūḥ oṁ bhuvaḥ oṁ svaḥ\noṁ mahaḥ oṁ janaḥ oṁ tapaḥ oṁ satyaṁ\ntatsaviturvareṇyaṁ bhargo devasya dhīmahi\ndhiyo yo naḥ pracodayāt\noṁ āpo jyotīraso amṛtaṁ brahma bhūrbhuvassuvarom\n",
      "verifyNotes": "Head, heart and nose instructions alternate with Sanskrit. Gāyatrī and closing formula are acoustically unverified.  All timestamps are caption-aligned; no direct human listening is claimed. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified.",
