      "originalScript": "ಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆಯನ್ನು ಕೈಯಲ್ಲಿ ಇಟ್ಟುಕೊಂಡು, ಎಡಗೈ ಮೇಲೆ ಬಲ ಕೈ ಇಟ್ಟು, ಬಲದ ತೊಡೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಇಡಿ.\nśubhe śobhane muhūrte ādya brahmaṇaḥ dvitīya parārdhe\nśrīśvetavarāhakalpe vaivasvatamanvantare aṣṭāviṁśatitame kaliyuge prathamapāde\nbharatavarṣe bharatakhaṇḍe daṇḍakāraṇye godāvaryāḥ dakṣiṇatīre\nśālivāhanaśake bauddhāvatāre rāmakṣetre\nasmin vartamāne prabhavādi ṣaṣṭi saṁvatsarāṇāṁ madhye śubha parābhavanāma saṁvatsare\ndakṣiṇāyane śaradṛtau āśvījamāse śuklapakṣe prathamāyāṁ\nvāsaraḥ vāsarastu bhānuvāsara yuktāyāṁ citrānakṣatra yuktāyāṁ\nśubhanakṣatra śubhayoga śubhakaraṇa evaṁguṇa sakalaviśeṣaṇa viśiṣṭāyāṁ śubhatithau\nasmat kuladevatāntaryāmi bhāratīramaṇa mukhyaprāṇāntargata śrī lakṣmī nārāyaṇa preraṇayā lakṣmī nārāyaṇa prītyarthaṁ\nśrī bhū durgā brahma prāṇa sarasvatī bhāratī śeṣa\nśrī bhū durgā brahma prāṇa sarasvatī bhāratī śeṣa garuḍādi sahitasya\nśrī lakṣmī nārāyaṇasya śrī śrīnivāsasya śrī lakṣmī narasiṁhasya\nನಿಮ್ಮ ಕುಲದೇವರ ಹೆಸರನ್ನು ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಸೇರಿಸಿಕೊಳ್ಳಿ.\nlakṣmī narasiṁhasya adya prathama prātarārabhya āgāmi daśamī paryantaṁ\n",
      "romanText": "maṁtrākṣateyannu kaiyalli iṭṭukoṁḍu, eḍagai mēle bala kai iṭṭu, balada toḍeyalli iḍi.\nśubhe śobhane muhūrte ādya brahmaṇaḥ dvitīya parārdhe\nśrīśvetavarāhakalpe vaivasvatamanvantare aṣṭāviṁśatitame kaliyuge prathamapāde\nbharatavarṣe bharatakhaṇḍe daṇḍakāraṇye godāvaryāḥ dakṣiṇatīre\nśālivāhanaśake bauddhāvatāre rāmakṣetre\nasmin vartamāne prabhavādi ṣaṣṭi saṁvatsarāṇāṁ madhye śubha parābhavanāma saṁvatsare\ndakṣiṇāyane śaradṛtau āśvījamāse śuklapakṣe prathamāyāṁ\nvāsaraḥ vāsarastu bhānuvāsara yuktāyāṁ citrānakṣatra yuktāyāṁ\nśubhanakṣatra śubhayoga śubhakaraṇa evaṁguṇa sakalaviśeṣaṇa viśiṣṭāyāṁ śubhatithau\nasmat kuladevatāntaryāmi bhāratīramaṇa mukhyaprāṇāntargata śrī lakṣmī nārāyaṇa preraṇayā lakṣmī nārāyaṇa prītyarthaṁ\nśrī bhū durgā brahma prāṇa sarasvatī bhāratī śeṣa\nśrī bhū durgā brahma prāṇa sarasvatī bhāratī śeṣa garuḍādi sahitasya\nśrī lakṣmī nārāyaṇasya śrī śrīnivāsasya śrī lakṣmī narasiṁhasya\nnimma kuladēvara hesarannu illi sērisikoḷḷi.\nlakṣmī narasiṁhasya adya prathama prātarārabhya āgāmi daśamī paryantaṁ\n",
      "verifyNotes": "Recorded year/date/place are examples, not verified current calendar instructions. Preserve all spoken names including the repeated deity sequence. Raw ASR varies ಮಂತ್ರಾಸ್ತೆ/ಮಂತ್ರಾಸ್ತೇ; interpreted ritual object mantra-akṣata is editorial correction supported by repeated usage. Retains recorded calendar/location examples; śālivāhanaśake/rāmakṣetre, exact tithi inflection, and antaryāmi form remain uncertain witness readings. Do not substitute present-day calendar. Repeated list deliberately retained. All timestamps are caption-aligned; no direct human listening is claimed. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified.",
