      "originalScript": "ಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆಯನ್ನು ತೊಕೊಂಡು ಆ ದೀಪಕ್ಕ ಪೂಜೆಯನ್ನು ಮಾಡಿರಿ.\nasmin dīpastambhe kṛttikādi saptaviṁśati nakṣatra devatābhyo namaḥ\naśvinyai namaḥ bharaṇyai namaḥ kṛttikāyai namaḥ rohiṇyai\nಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆ ಹಾಕ್ತಾ ಬರಬೇಕು.\nrohiṇyai namaḥ\nmṛgaśīrāyai namaḥ ārdrāyai namaḥ punarvasubhyo namaḥ\npuṣya nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nāśleṣā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nmaghā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\npūrvaphalgunī nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nuttaraphalgunī nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nhasta nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\ncitrā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nsvātī nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nviśākhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nanurādhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\njyeṣṭhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nmūla nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\npūrvāṣāḍhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nuttarāṣāḍhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nśravaṇa nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\ndhaniṣṭhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nśatabhiṣak nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\npūrvabhādrā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nuttarabhādrā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nrevatī nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nnakṣatrābhimāni śrī lakṣmī nārāyaṇāya namaḥ\nಅಂತ ಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆ ಹಾಕಿ.\nnakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ sthāpayāmi pūjayāmi namaḥ\n",
      "romanText": "maṁtrākṣateyannu tokoṁḍu ā dīpakka pūjeyannu māḍiri.\nasmin dīpastambhe kṛttikādi saptaviṁśati nakṣatra devatābhyo namaḥ\naśvinyai namaḥ bharaṇyai namaḥ kṛttikāyai namaḥ rohiṇyai\nmaṁtrākṣate hāktā barabēku.\nrohiṇyai namaḥ\nmṛgaśīrāyai namaḥ ārdrāyai namaḥ punarvasubhyo namaḥ\npuṣya nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nāśleṣā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nmaghā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\npūrvaphalgunī nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nuttaraphalgunī nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nhasta nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\ncitrā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nsvātī nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nviśākhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nanurādhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\njyeṣṭhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nmūla nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\npūrvāṣāḍhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nuttarāṣāḍhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nśravaṇa nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\ndhaniṣṭhā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nśatabhiṣak nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\npūrvabhādrā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nuttarabhādrā nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nrevatī nakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ\nnakṣatrābhimāni śrī lakṣmī nārāyaṇāya namaḥ\naṁta maṁtrākṣate hāki.\nnakṣatradevatābhyo namaḥ sthāpayāmi pūjayāmi namaḥ\n",
      "verifyNotes": "The list begins with Aśvinī despite opening generic formula apparently Kṛttikādi. Retain actual order, interposed akṣata instruction and closing establishment formula. Opening Kṛttikādi retained despite subsequent list starting Aśvinī. Rohiṇī is interrupted by instruction then repeated. Punarvasu inflection and final nārāyaṇāya/nārāyaṇābhyāṁ differ among witnesses; list retains all27 stars. Individual rapid lines share whole-run playback until independently aligned. All timestamps are caption-aligned; no direct human listening is claimed. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified.",
