      "originalScript": "ಅಂತ ಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆ ಹಾಕಿ. ನಾಳೆ ಅಂದರೆ ಬತ್ತಿಯಲ್ಲಿ\nvāsukī devatāyai namaḥ anantāya namaḥ\npāde candrāya namaḥ candrārkābhyaṁ namaḥ\njyotiṣi sūryacandrāya namaḥ\n",
      "romanText": "aṁta maṁtrākṣate hāki. nāḷe aṁdare battiyalli\nvāsukī devatāyai namaḥ anantāya namaḥ\npāde candrāya namaḥ candrārkābhyaṁ namaḥ\njyotiṣi sūryacandrāya namaḥ\n",
      "verifyNotes": "Caption suggests Vāsuki in wick, Ananta, Candra at base and Sūrya–Candra in light; exact physical placements require audio. ನಾಳೆ/nāḷe may be Sanskrit nāle (in the tube) or Kannada sound; preserved rather than translated as tomorrow, which would not fit the placement context. Exact jyotiṣi/jyotyau and sūryacandrāya inflection uncertain. Do not invent additional placements for Ananta or Candra–Arka. All timestamps are caption-aligned; no direct human listening is claimed. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified.",
