      "originalScript": "ಎಲ್ಲಮ್ಮ ಈ ರೀತಿ ಇರುವ ದುರ್ಗಾ ದೇವಿಗಳು ಅಂದರೆ\nkātyāyanyai vidmahe kanyakumāri dhīmahi\ntanno durgiḥ pracodayāt\ndurgāṁ kuladevatāyai durgāntaryāmi lakṣmīnarasiṁham āvāhayāmi\nಅಂತ ಆವಾಹನವನ್ನು ಮಾಡಿರಿ. ಆವಾಹಯಾಮಿ ಅಂತ ಮಂತ್ರಾಕ್ಷತೆ ಹಾಕಿ.\n",
      "romanText": "ellamma ī rīti iruva durgā dēvigaḷu aṁdare\nkātyāyanyai vidmahe kanyakumāri dhīmahi\ntanno durgiḥ pracodayāt\ndurgāṁ kuladevatāyai durgāntaryāmi lakṣmīnarasiṁham āvāhayāmi\naṁta āvāhanavannu māḍiri. āvāhayāmi aṁta maṁtrākṣate hāki.\n",
      "verifyNotes": "The Kātyāyanī/Kanyakumārī formula and Durgāntaryāmi Lakṣmī Narasiṃha wording require corroboration. Kātyāyanī inflection and kanyakumāri ending uncertain. GPT hears durgāṁ tarpayāmi; captions favor durgāntaryāmi. Retain review flag rather than claim exact lexical resolution. All timestamps are caption-aligned; no direct human listening is claimed. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified.",
