      "originalScript": "ಕೂತುಕೊಂಡು ಪ್ರಾರ್ಥನೆಯನ್ನು ಮಾಡಿರಿ.\nānandatīrthavarade dānavāraṇyapāvake\njñānadāyini sadveśe śrīnivāse’stu me manaḥ\nಹಾಗೆ ಅಂತ ಪ್ರಾರ್ಥನೆಯನ್ನು ಮಾಡಿ ಹಾಕಿರಿ.\nsaṁsṛṣṭaṁ dhanam ubhayaṁ samākṛtaṁ asmabhyaṁ dattāṁ varuṇaśca manyuḥ\nbhiyaṁ dadhānā hṛdayeṣu śatravaḥ parājitāso apanilayantām\nಅಂತ ನರಸಿಂಹನನ್ನು ಪ್ರಾರ್ಥನೆ ಮಾಡಿಕೊಳ್ಳಿರಿ.\nsarvamaṅgalamāṅgalye śive sarvārthasādhike\nśaraṇye tryambake devi nārāyaṇi namo’stute\nಅಂತ ಪ್ರಾರ್ಥನೆಯನ್ನು ಮಾಡಿಟ್ಟು.\n",
      "romanText": "kūtukoṁḍu prārthaneyannu māḍiri.\nānandatīrthavarade dānavāraṇyapāvake\njñānadāyini sadveśe śrīnivāse’stu me manaḥ\nhāge aṁta prārthaneyannu māḍi hākiri.\nsaṁsṛṣṭaṁ dhanam ubhayaṁ samākṛtaṁ asmabhyaṁ dattāṁ varuṇaśca manyuḥ\nbhiyaṁ dadhānā hṛdayeṣu śatravaḥ parājitāso apanilayantām\naṁta narasiṁhanannu prārthane māḍikoḷḷiri.\nsarvamaṅgalamāṅgalye śive sarvārthasādhike\nśaraṇye tryambake devi nārāyaṇi namo’stute\naṁta prārthaneyannu māḍiṭṭu.\n",
      "verifyNotes": "Three separate prayers. Saṃsṛṣṭaṃ dhanam has severe ASR corruption; targeted retranscription needed. All acoustic ASR outputs hear dānavāraṇya pālake / jñānadāgine / sadveśe. Here pāvake/jñānadāyini are provisional intelligible readings, not certified. Entire verse requires close listening. Severe unresolved exact reading in final Manyu prayer. GPT gives varuṇasya manyuḥ and bhiyam dadānaḥ hṛdayeṣu śatrā/aparājitāśo; current Sanskrit reconstruction and meaning explicitly provisional, not claimed acoustic exactness. All timestamps are caption-aligned; no direct human listening is claimed. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified. Block boundaries have been manually aligned to embedded native VTT marker transitions; exact individual-word synchronization remains uncertified.",
